        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "修道士は、質素な衣を身につけ、静かに祈りを捧げていた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "湯上がりに、ふかふかの衣を羽織ると、とても気持ちがいい。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "卒業式には、学生たちが一様にガウンの衣をまとって出席した。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "gloss": "coating (e.g. glaze, batter, icing)",
        "register": "standard",
